 in this sequel to the magical Disney Channel original movie Twitches. But they soon find themselves going head to head with the forces of darkness that threaten to destroy their world. Luckily, their birth mother, the powerful Miranda, is on hand to help out.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":363486,\"title\":\"Just in Time for Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uyaCUEil9nBQmnCtt5zGcmztLXB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rYIObbhZGLAK4rlrLDSKhc8Vrh0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lindsay is faced with a life-altering decision as Christmas approaches: Stay in her tiny hometown and marry boyfriend Jason or accept a coveted post teaching at an Ivy League college on the other side of the country. What to do? Fortunately for Lindsay, she has some big-time help in the form of a magical messenger who is able to transport her three years into the future to see how it would all turn out.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":32790,\"title\":\"The Good Witch\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nZVOeGCbhLzIfCOB7BCvIrE2TaY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6W5zmMhUO9yHuVbsYQTJnjLFQnT.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A mysterious woman comes in to town and inhabits the local haunted mansion, making everyone wonder if she's a witch or \\\"The Grey Lady\\\".\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14711,\"title\":\"Afro Samurai: Resurrection\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6snrLj3Ydmbu5L9giAYtiSNwE0U.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4rNjTccVltQHKKJd6INzqHtfV5x.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Afro Samurai avenged his father and found a life of peace. But the legendary master is forced back into the game by a beautiful and deadly woman fr